{"id":"nuage","lemma":"nuage","pos":"noun","rank":2831,"glosses":["cloud"],"ipa":"/ny.aʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/Fr-nuage.ogg/Fr-nuage.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nuages"},"formAudio":{"nuages":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-nuages.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il y avait des nuages, hier.","en":"It was cloudy yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2253","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Regarde le nuage là-bas.","en":"Look at the cloud over there.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"low"}]},{"text":"Cette montagne est dans les nuages.","en":"That mountain is in the clouds.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"mountain"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Le soleil a disparu derrière un nuage.","en":"The sun vanished behind a cloud.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sun"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"disappeared"},{"g":"behind"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Regarde ces nuages.","en":"Look at those clouds.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]}]}